      ],
      "application_cycle": "rolling",
      "next_deadline": "PIP Round 4 award expected mid 2026; 295 South Mathilda ENA extended November 2025 with construction targeted 2027 after a tax credit application in 2026. Future City-owned sites would be offered by ENA or RFP.",
      "prevailing_wage_trigger": "true",
      "layering_notes": "Prohousing status improves scores for AHSC, IIG and MHP applications by Sunnyvale projects. The City's land contribution model (buy the site, ground lease to the nonprofit, then fund through the NOFA) mirrors Mountain View and San Jose practice and locks in TCAC opportunity-area status. sunnyvale.ca.gov blocked; information taken from the 2025 Housing Element APR read on Legistar.",
